patch 2. Presentation contract appends both omission lines after activity and lanes; preserve placement and defer alternate compact presentation.'),\n'R14':('defer','Preserve the full-suite 7249/2 failure and isolated 14/14 success as a potential timing flake in unchanged viewer fallback. No evidence establishes a PRD regression. Fresh full-suite result is separately recorded below; retain flake follow-up even if it passes.'),\n'R15':('discard','Duplicate of actionable R10; its task carries the assertion-guard defect. Raw Bob finding retained.'),\n'R16':('discard','Duplicate of actionable R9; its task carries duplicate assertion cleanup. Raw Bob finding retained.'),\n'R17':('discard','Duplicate of deferred R3; newline separator limitation is recorded once. Raw Bob finding retained.'),\n'R18':('discard','Duplicate of deferred R7; exact tool identity limitation is recorded once. Raw Bob finding retained.'),\n'R19':('discard','Duplicate of deferred R13; constrained-height omission visibility is recorded once. Raw Bob finding retained.'),\n'R20':('defer','Verification limitation retained: old-code fail-first replay was blocked by worktree permissions. Bob names a multi-step checkout/copy/run procedure, not one exact allowed verification command, so not queued: command shape. Original build red checks and mutation evidence remain available; no claim of completed replay.')}\nrows=[]\nfor line in review.splitlines():\n if re.match(r'\"'^'\"\\\\| R\\\\d+ \\\\|',line):\n  c=[x.strip() for x in line.split('|')][1:-1];rows.append(dict(ref=c[0],severity=c[2],issue=c[3],file=c[4],found_by=c[6].split(', '),classification=reasons[c[0]][0]))\nassert len(rows)==20\nadjudication='## Decision gate\\\\n\\\\nCycle 1, cap 2: R1 is a settled design deferral; R4 remains an unresolved HIGH additive coverage defect. Rework is allowed (1 < 2). No CRITICAL, security issue, data-loss risk, foundational blocker or new dependency. Seven unique findings need fixes; grouping is delegated unchanged to review-close (maximum four tasks). Original implementations followed the transmitted design: no capability retry or original-task escalation. D1 follow-ups are new pinned tasks at logical sonnet, without the initial opus floor.\\\\n\\\\n'\nfor row in rows:\n action,reason=reasons[row['ref']];adjudication+=f\\\"- {row['ref']}: {action}. {reason}\\\\n\\\"\nadjudication+='\\\\nThe review-close source uses the historical action label \"'`auto-fixed` when tasks are queued; no fix has run in this session. Pending task status and this handoff are authoritative. Rework must preserve the exact design contract above; findings demanding deferred behavior changes are not permission to implement them.'\"\\\\n\\\\n'\nreview=review.replace('## Alice\\\\n',adjudication+'## Alice\\\\n')\nreview=re.sub(r'Tests: 7251 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped \\\\(reused from last-verification.json at ab3101b; separate Blake failures retained above\\\\)','Tests: pending foreground suite',review)\n(root/'reviews'/f'{stem}-review-1.md').write_text(review)\nPath(f'docs/dev/tmp/{stem}-decision-gate-1-findings.json').write_text(json.dumps(rows,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nledger=[dict(cycle=1,disposition='settled-deferral' if r['classification']=='defer' else 'discarded',severity=r['severity'],issue=r['issue'],file=r['file'],reason=reasons[r['ref']][1]) for r in rows if r['classification'] in ['defer','discard']]\n(root/'reviews'/f'{stem}-ledger.json').write_text(json.dumps(ledger,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nPath('docs/dev/tmp/00054-c1-classifications.json').write_text(json.dumps([dict(cycle=1,issue=r['issue'],severity={'🟠':'high','🟡':'medium','⚪':'low'}[r['severity']],action='queued for rework' if r['classification']=='fix' else r['classification'],reason=reasons[r['ref']][1]) for r in rows],indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nprint('Canonical draft, exact chosen findings, 13 settled ledger entries and 20 classification decisions prepared.')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"Canonical draft, exact chosen findings, 13 settled ledger entries and 20 classification decisions prepared.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
